cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "USDC holders and the 2022 Tornado Cash freezes: code, signed pre-specification and aggregate results"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Code, the pre-specification signed on 28 October 2026 (byte for byte), its addenda and the aggregate results for the paper 'Issuer Discretion and Stablecoin Holdings after the Tornado Cash Sanction' (Khosravipour, 2026). The data are rebuilt from raw Ethereum mainnet JSON-RPC calls. Wallet-level data are not distributed; the code regenerates them from public logs."
